  "failure": {
    "body": "### Is it platform specific\n\nbroadcom\n\n### Importance or Severity\n\nHigh\n\n### Description of the enhancement\n\nPorting SONiC to a new Nexthop Systems device. Adding device-specific hardware drivers as well as device-specific configuration files to initialize a Nexthop TH5 based switch.\n\n### Current Behavior\n\nNo current SONiC support exists for any Nexthop based hardware.\n\n### Proposed Behavior\n\nSONiC can boot and recognize a Nexthop TH5 switch. Peripheral hardware can be configured via SONiC Platform APIs."
  },
