    "merged_at": "2025-08-06T15:05:23Z",
    "description": "#### Why I did it\nFixes #22821\n- Please ignore commits like `IGNORE THIS COMMIT: Multiple FPGAs w/ I2C IP block (PR #22748)`\n- Add platform folders for initial Nexthop NH-4010 SKU\n\n##### Work item tracking\n- Microsoft ADO **(number only)**:\n\n#### How I did it\nAdd platform specific changes to:\n- `device/nexthop`\n- `platform/broadcom/sonic-platform-modules-nexthop`\n\n#### How to verify it\n\n#### Which release branch to backport (provide reason below if selected)\n\n- [ ] 201811\n- [ ] 201911\n- [ ] 202006\n- [ ] 202012\n- [ ] 202106\n- [ ] 202111\n- [ ] 202205\n- [ ] 202211\n- [ ] 202305\n\n#### Tested branch (Please provide the tested image version)\n\n- [ ]\n- [ ]\n\n#### Description for the changelog\n\n#### Link to config_db schema for YANG module changes\n\n#### A picture of a cute animal (not mandatory but encouraged)",
